# Scoring / co-play (domain)

## Non-negotiables

- Crossing a threshold creates a **pending suggestion**, never an auto-promote
- Council / Prophet are never suggestion targets from points
- Threshold numbers live only in `Data/Ranks.lua`
- Cities / solo open-world / idle resting areas grant **nothing**
- Knight/Lord rites **coach** via checklists — they do not hard-block suggestions

## Sources (V1)

| Source | Counts when | Intent |
|--------|-------------|--------|
| Shared instance | Dungeon / raid / BG with ≥1 **guildmate** in party/raid | Dungeon/BG drip; **raid weighted heavier** toward Butcher; shared instance daily cap |
| Quest fellowship | Open-world party with ≥1 guildmate; not resting; combat or quest turn-in in bucket | Medium-small drip; **strict daily quest cap** below instance |
| Ceremony | Officer starts; credit on clean close; Knighting label + honoree sets `knighted` | Medium flat grant |
| Beef Gora | Challenge → recorded win/loss/draw; win vs mapped Beef Lord sets `goraLordWin` | Win > draw > loss; **losses still pay** |

Guildmates need not run the addon for local co-play credit.

## Anti-abuse (locked intent)

- **Anti-AFK:** instance/quest buckets pay only if combat (or quest turn-in for fellowship) occurred in that bucket
- Per-day caps per source (instance, quest, ceremony, gora)
- Completion bonus is best-effort — Classic dungeon-complete signals can be flaky
- Officer manual adjust/wipe remains the correction tool

## Suggestion boundary

```text
points accrue locally → MaybeSuggest (next point-driven rank only)
                     → Officer sees promote prompt (+ Knight/Lord rite checklist)
                     → Officer promotes in Blizzard guild UI
                     → roster refresh moves the name; suggestion auto-clears
```

Dismiss clears suggestion; standing remains unless officer corrects.

## Pacing

A new member’s first full dungeon night with guildmates should be able to earn Fresh → Cooked eligibility. Butcher is a standing capstone — raid loyalty is the intended main fuel.
